Package: y700-input-pinyin
Version: 0.1.0~dev3
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Y700 Linux OS contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: accountsservice, im-config, ibus, ibus-gtk3, ibus-libpinyin, fonts-noto-cjk, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Description: English and Simplified Chinese input on the Y700 tablet
 Offers a per-user Xfce display language setting and a language menu in
 the GTK greeter. Includes Intelligent Pinyin in the initial IBus menu.
